Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,what the f***?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:02.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,could 38-year-old steph
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:03.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,curry outshoot the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.58,0:00:04.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,english archers at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:05.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,the battle of agincourt?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:06.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,except these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.48,0:00:07.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,guys were the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.12,0:00:08.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,deadliest shooters of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,the middle ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.54,0:00:10.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,saturday night, curry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:12.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,dropped 41 on orlando,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.74,0:00:14.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,13 of 19,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.44,0:00:15.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,10 for 10 from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:17.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,the line, in overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,he's also the only
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,player in nba history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,with 4,000 made threes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.42,0:00:24.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,meanwhile, october 25th,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.40,0:00:26.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,1415, a muddy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:28.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,field in northern france.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:28.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,thousands of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.36,0:00:29.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,english longbowmen, each
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,firing about 10
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:31.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,arrows a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.90,0:00:33.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,so curry time travels
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,to the front line.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.30,0:00:35.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,one ball, one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:37.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,hoop, no shot clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:37.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,the archers fire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.96,0:00:39.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first volley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.06,0:00:40.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the sky goes dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.78,0:00:41.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,curry pulls up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,from 200 yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:44.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.04,0:00:45.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,night night, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,french knights charge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,through the mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.08,0:00:47.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,curry hits a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:48.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,step-back over a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.54,0:00:50.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,horse, and one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,the archers adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,volley after volley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,curry answers every one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.24,0:00:55.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,splash!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:56.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,night night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:57.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,at halftime, two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:58.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,monks on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,studio desk call
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:00:59.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,it the greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.82,0:01:00.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,shooting display of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:02.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,the 15th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.26,0:01:03.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,final volley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:04.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,curry slips in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.08,0:01:05.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,mud, falls backwards, and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.56,0:01:07.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,banks it in anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.20,0:01:08.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score, curry
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.36,0:01:11.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,213, archers zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.16,0:01:11.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,arrows don't count
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:12.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,without a hoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.90,0:01:13.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,king henry knights
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:14.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,him on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.90,0:01:15.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,sir stephen still
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:15.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,has to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:16.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,home by tip-off.
